{"id": "65569", "title": "军政联姻（又名：温柔老公倔强妻）", "author": "柒草", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65569.htm", "intro": "他是京城权势倾天的爷，军长挚爱的宠孙，黑帮第三代继承人。  \r\n只有施以默最清楚，这个表面温润的男人有多危险，他总是披着张温柔的羊皮，然后反手将她啃得连骨头都不剩。  \r\n第一次相遇，他看她的眼神仿若猎豹寻到满意的猎物，那个时候开始，她就明白，自己招惹上他了。  \r\n为了得到她，他不择手段，将她这只手无缚鸡的猫逼至绝境，她却倔强的想要用猫的力量，击溃他这头凶猛的老虎。  \r\n他出国办公，却千方百计将她一同挟持去国外，如果不是她没那雷胆，施以默一定会毫不犹豫挥他一拳！  \r\n那些迷疯了他的小粉丝，眼睛是长在裤裆里的吧？", "base": "files/article/html/65/65569", "chapters": [{"title": "1-6", "file": "9755704.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-11", "file": "9755706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-16", "file": "9755708.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-21", "file": "9755710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-26", "file": "9755712.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27-31", "file": "9755713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-37", "file": "9755714.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-43", "file": "9755716.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-49", "file": "9755718.html", "available": false}, {"title": "50-55", "file": "9755720.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "9755722.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "9755723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "9755724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-72", "file": "9755726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "73", "file": "9755728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "74", "file": "9755730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "75", "file": "9755733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76", "file": "9755735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-78", "file": "9755742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "79-80", "file": "9755745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-82", "file": "9755747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "83-85", "file": "9755750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-87", "file": "9755752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "88-90", "fi